          "title": "You'll want to know: ঘামা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঘামা — ghāmā — \"to sweat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গরমে বাসে বসে আমি ঘামছিলাম। gôrôme bāse bôse āmi ghāmchhilām. Sitting on the bus in the heat, I was sweating."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি রোদে ঘামলেন, tini rode ghāmlen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun is ঘাম, sweat: ঘামে ভেজা জামা, a shirt wet with sweat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঘামা (ghāmā) is the verb of ghām, \"sweat\", which CDIAL lists for Bengali under Sanskrit gharma, \"heat\" (CDIAL 4445)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
