              "text": "মীরার গালে একটা ছোট তিল আছে। mīrār gāle ekṭā chhoṭo til āchhe. Mira has a small mole on her cheek."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "তিল (til) is also the sesame seed; CDIAL thinks the two may be one word."
            }
          ]
        },
