          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "তিল (til) is Sanskrit tila, \"a mole on the skin\" (CDIAL 5828), which CDIAL thinks may be the same word as tila, the sesame seed: a seed-sized dark spot."
            }
